ext xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" text-anchor="end" transform="translate(352.87971055464317 317.84) rotate(-40)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">vervet</text><text text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(230.8522720336914 24)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">  </text><text text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(230.8522720336914 437.859287109375)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">  Type of monkey</text></g></svg><div role="region" aria-label="Long description for bar graph" class="sr-only"><ul>
<li>The Number of monkeys data for the 5 bars are as follows:<br>
<ul>
<li>mandrill: 5</li>
<li>baboon: 7</li>
<li>pygmy marmoset: 8</li>
<li>bonnet macaque: 9</li>
<li>vervet: 11</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul></div></figure></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">How many more vervets are in this sanctuary than mandrills?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"7743c1d1-3ad6-448c-a1b2-a9066e554868","content":"<p><math alttext=\"11\"><mn>11</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"889b904e-30ab-464c-963f-0806c52eb92a","content":"<p><math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"6c036ad2-213c-4da6-8682-0f7709a016e6","content":"<p><math alttext=\"5\"><mn>5</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"41f23540-e34b-474c-924f-51b917336c01","content":"<p><math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["B"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["889b904e-30ab-464c-963f-0806c52eb92a"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is correct. It's given that the bar graph shows the number of each type of monkey in a sanctuary. The bar representing the number of mandrills has a height of <math alttext="5"><mn>5</mn>
</math>; therefore, there are <math alttext="5"><mn>5</mn>
</math> mandrills in the sanctuary. The bar representing vervets has a height of <math alttext="11"><mn>11</mn>
</math>; therefore, there are <math alttext="11"><mn>11</mn>
</math> vervets in the sanctuary. Therefore, there are <math alttext="11 minus 5"><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>, or <math alttext="6"><mn>6</mn>
</math>, more vervets in this sanctuary than mandrills.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice A is incorrect. This is the number of vervets in the sanctuary.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect. This is the number of mandrills in the sanctuary.&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"57481175","external_id":"132dc872-80cb-43fa-b1c9-3dc7fea2a1a5","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"b64c2642-3a24-47f5-98ed-15e0e60fa659","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"Q","domain":"Problem-Solving and Data Analysis","skill_cd":"Q.C.","skill_desc":"One-variable data: Distributions and measures of center and spread","difficulty":"E","score_band_range_cd":1,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The bar graph shows the number of each type of monkey in a sanctuary.&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"466.019287109375\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 466.019287109375\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A bar graph. The horizontal axis is labeled Type of monkey. 5 bars are shown. The vertical axis is labeled Number of monkeys. It ranges from 0 to 12 in increments of 1. Refer to long description.\"><g id=\"ed420550-79eb-48d4-af01-cd27cdd08af0\" data-name=\"Layer 1\"><defs>\n      <pattern id=\"bar4\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"10\" height=\"100\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" patternTransform=\"rotate(50)\">\n  \t\t<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"5\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#CDCDCD\"></rect>\n  \t\t<rect x=\"5\" y=\"0\" width=\"5\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#444444\"></rect>\n      </pattern>\n      </defs><line xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x1=\"76.70454406738281\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"385\" y2=\"48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"></line><line xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x1=\"70.70454406738281\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"82.70454406738281\" y2=\"48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=